msgid ""
"    | Kernel acceleration | Triton Ascend | `{{ "
"release_triton_ascend_version }}` | Used on A2, A3, and 950DT Products; not "
"used on Atlas 300I DUO or Atlas 200I Pro |"
msgstr ""
"    | 内核加速 | Triton Ascend | `{{ release_triton_ascend_version }}` | 用于 "
"A2、A3 和 Ascend 950DT系列产品；不用于 Atlas 300I DUO 或 Atlas 200I Pro |"

msgid "???+ important \"950DT Products server precheck\""
msgstr "???+ important \"Ascend 950DT系列产品服务器预检查\""

msgid ""
"This precheck applies only to 950DT Products servers. Other server series "
"can skip it."
msgstr "此预检查仅适用于 Ascend 950DT系列产品服务器。其他服务器系列可以跳过。"

msgid ""
"- When deploying a 950DT Products inference service, confirm on each server "
"that `/lib/route.conf`, `/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`, and the `/etc/hixlep` "
"directory that describes the UB link topology exist and are configured "
"correctly. If any item is missing or misconfigured, follow the [HiXLEP "
"configuration file generation "
"guide](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" to generate the required content. Select the \"D2D scenario\" when "
"generating `/etc/hixlep`."
msgstr ""
"- 部署 Ascend 950DT系列产品推理服务时，请在每台服务器上确认 "
"`/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json` 以及描述 UB 链路拓扑的 `/etc/hixlep` "
"目录存在且配置正确。如果任何一项缺失或配置错误，请按照 [HiXLEP "
"配置文件生成指南](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" 生成所需内容。生成 `/etc/hixlep` 时请选择 \"D2D scenario\"。"

msgid "=== \"950DT Products\""
msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid "!!! danger \"v0.30.0rc2 installation support\""
msgstr "!!! danger \"v0.30.0rc2 安装支持\""

msgid ""
"v0.30.0rc2 currently supports only the [official vLLM Ascend "
"images](#installation-prebuilt-image-selection) or [building an image with "
"`docker build`](#installation-prebuilt-image-build). Installation in a CANN "
"image or a manually prepared CANN environment, including pip/uv wheel and "
"direct source installation, is not yet supported for rc2."
msgstr ""
"v0.30.0rc2 目前仅支持 [官方 vLLM Ascend 镜像](#installation-prebuilt-image-selection)"
" 或 [使用 `docker build` 构建镜像](#installation-prebuilt-image-build)。在 CANN "
"镜像或手动准备的 CANN 环境中安装（包括 pip/uv wheel 和直接源码安装）在 rc2 中尚不支持。"

msgid "This document describes how to install vLLM Ascend manually."
msgstr "本文档介绍如何手动安装 vLLM Ascend。"

msgid ""
"**PyTorch and TorchNPU:** Installed as dependencies during the **Install "
"vLLM and vLLM Ascend** step; no separate installation step is required."
msgstr ""
"**PyTorch 和 TorchNPU：** 在 **安装 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend** 步骤中作为依赖项安装，无需单独安装。"

msgid ""
"The output should list the expected NPU devices, with `Health` shown as `OK`"
" and no driver initialization errors. Device names, chip counts, and table "
"columns vary by hardware and driver version. A missing device or a health "
"status other than `OK` needs investigation before continuing."
msgstr ""
"输出应列出预期的 NPU 设备，`Health` 显示为 "
"`OK`，且没有驱动初始化错误。设备名称、芯片数量和表格列会因硬件和驱动版本而异。如果缺少设备或健康状态不是 `OK`，需要先排查问题再继续。"

msgid ""
"The host Linux distribution and kernel must be supported by the selected "
"Ascend hardware and driver/firmware release. For more information, see the "
"[Ascend compatibility "
"query](https://info.support.huawei.com/computing/tools/compatibility-"
"query/enterprise/ascend-computing/system-compatibility) and [CANN "
"installation "
"resources](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)."
msgstr ""
"主机的 Linux 发行版和内核必须受所选昇腾硬件及驱动/固件版本支持。更多信息请参见[Ascend "
"兼容性查询](https://info.support.huawei.com/computing/tools/compatibility-"
"query/enterprise/ascend-computing/system-compatibility)和[CANN "
"安装资源](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)。"

msgid ""
"Use this workflow on the **main branch** to check Python package "
"construction and editable installation without an NPU. It skips native "
"extensions and custom kernels, so it does not require CANN, an Ascend "
"driver, PyTorch, TorchNPU, or vLLM. It does not provide CPU inference or an "
"environment for running the unit tests."
msgstr ""
"在**主分支**上使用此流程，可在没有 NPU 的情况下检查 Python 包的构建和可编辑安装。该流程会跳过原生扩展和自定义算子，因此不需要 "
"CANN、昇腾驱动、PyTorch、TorchNPU 或 vLLM。它不提供 CPU 推理能力，也不提供运行单元测试的环境。"

msgid ""
"Use Linux (`x86_64` or `aarch64`), Git, and Python {{ main_python_version }}"
" with `venv` support. For an isolated check, you can start a disposable "
"Python container without device mappings or driver mounts:"
msgstr ""
"使用 Linux（`x86_64` 或 `aarch64`）、Git，以及支持 `venv` 的 Python {{ "
"main_python_version }}。如需进行隔离检查，可以启动一个不映射设备、不挂载驱动的临时 Python 容器："

msgid ""
"Run the remaining commands inside the container. Get the source and create a"
" dedicated virtual environment. If you already have a main-branch checkout "
"in your chosen environment, start from that repository's root instead of "
"cloning again:"
msgstr "在容器内运行其余命令。获取源码并创建专用的虚拟环境。如果你所选环境中已有主分支的代码检出，请从该仓库根目录开始，而不要再次克隆："

msgid "Build and install the Python package:"
msgstr "构建并安装 Python 包："

msgid ""
"- `COMPILE_CUSTOM_KERNELS=0` skips building the native extensions and custom operators. These components are enabled by default for a normal NPU installation.\n"
"- `SOC_VERSION` supplies the package's target hardware without querying `npu-smi`. Use `ascend910b1` for A2, `ascend910_9391` for A3, `ascend310p1` for Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro, or `ascend950dt_9582` for 950DT Products. This selects build metadata; it does not emulate an NPU.\n"
"- `--no-build-isolation` uses the packaging tools installed in this virtual environment instead of installing the full `pyproject.toml` build requirements.\n"
"- `--no-deps` skips runtime dependencies from `requirements.txt`. Do not install those dependencies for this packaging-only check."
msgstr ""
"- `COMPILE_CUSTOM_KERNELS=0` 跳过构建原生扩展和自定义算子。在常规 NPU 安装中，这些组件默认启用。\n"
"- `SOC_VERSION` 无需查询 `npu-smi` 即可指定包的目标硬件。A2 使用 `ascend910b1`，A3 使用 `ascend910_9391`，Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro 使用 `ascend310p1`，Ascend 950DT系列产品使用 `ascend950dt_9582`。此变量仅选择构建元数据，并不会模拟 NPU。\n"
"- `--no-build-isolation` 使用此虚拟环境中已安装的打包工具，而不是安装 `pyproject.toml` 中完整的构建依赖。\n"
"- `--no-deps` 跳过 `requirements.txt` 中的运行时依赖。此检查仅针对打包，请勿安装这些依赖。"

msgid ""
"The variable assignments apply only to the installation command, so they do "
"not disable custom-kernel compilation in a later shell command."
msgstr "这些变量赋值仅对安装命令生效，因此不会在后续的 shell 命令中禁用自定义算子编译。"

msgid ""
"Verify the installed package metadata without importing the NPU runtime:"
msgstr "在不导入 NPU 运行时的情况下验证已安装包的元数据："

msgid ""
"The installation command must finish successfully and the metadata check "
"must print `CPU-only package build: OK`. This verifies packaging only. "
"Runtime dependencies are intentionally absent, so `python -m pip check` will"
" report missing dependencies in this environment; importing runtime modules "
"or running inference is not a success criterion here."
msgstr ""
"安装命令必须成功完成，且元数据检查必须输出 `CPU-only package build: OK`。这仅验证打包。运行时依赖被有意省略，因此 "
"`python -m pip check` 在此环境中会报告缺少依赖；导入运行时模块或运行推理并不是此处的成功标准。"

msgid ""
"For CPU unit tests, prepare a separate environment using [Testing > Set up a"
" test environment](../developer_guide/contribution/testing.md#set-up-a-test-"
"environment). When developing against main, install the exact vLLM commit "
"recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`; [Contributing > Run CI "
"locally](../developer_guide/contribution/index.md#run-ci-locally) provides "
"the checkout and installation commands."
msgstr ""
"对于 CPU 单元测试，请使用[测试 > 搭建测试环境](../developer_guide/contribution/testing.md#set-"
"up-a-test-environment)准备一个独立环境。基于主分支开发时，请安装 `.github/vllm-main-"
"verified.commit` 中记录的精确 vLLM 提交；[贡献 > 本地运行 "
"CI](../developer_guide/contribution/index.md#run-ci-locally)提供了检出和安装命令。"

msgid ""
"Exit the disposable container when finished; `--rm` removes it and the files"
" created inside it."
msgstr "完成后退出临时容器；`--rm` 会删除该容器及其内部创建的文件。"

msgid ""
"The commands below use `hccn_tool` (Huawei Collective Communications Network"
" Tool), the Ascend NPU cluster network management tool installed with the "
"driver. if the command is missing, check the driver installation and "
"executable path."
msgstr ""
"以下命令使用 `hccn_tool`（Huawei Collective Communications Network Tool），这是随驱动安装的昇腾"
" NPU 集群网络管理工具。如果找不到该命令，请检查驱动安装情况和可执行文件路径。"

msgid "Run the following commands on each node in order:"
msgstr "在每个节点上按顺序运行以下命令："

msgid ""
"- `-link -g` should report `link status: UP`.\n"
"- `-net_health -g` should report `net health status: Success`.\n"
"- LLDP, network detection, gateway, and configuration queries print their respective settings. Check these against your cluster's network configuration; they do not all print a `success` message."
msgstr ""
"- `-link -g` 应报告 `link status: UP`。\n"
"- `-net_health -g` 应报告 `net health status: Success`。\n"
"- LLDP、网络检测、网关和配置查询会输出各自的设置。请将这些设置与集群的网络配置进行核对；它们并不都会输出 `success` 消息。"

msgid ""
"On the source node, use a local NPU device ID and an NPU IP address obtained"
" from the other node. The destination is the remote NPU's network address, "
"not the host's management IP:"
msgstr ""
"在源节点上，使用本地 NPU 设备 ID 和从另一节点获取的 NPU IP 地址。目标地址是远端 NPU 的网络地址，而不是主机的管理 IP："

msgid ""
"Successful output includes received replies and a summary with equal "
"transmitted/received packet counts and zero packet loss, for example:"
msgstr "成功的输出会包含收到的回复，以及一个发送/接收数据包数量相等且丢包率为零的摘要，例如："

msgid ""
"Repeat for the NPU pairs used by your deployment in both directions. Missing"
" replies or packet loss require checking the links, NPU IP addresses, and "
"network configuration. This checks basic connectivity; it does not replace a"
" distributed inference test."
msgstr ""
"对部署中使用的 NPU 对，在两个方向上重复此操作。如果缺少回复或出现丢包，需要检查链路、NPU IP "
"地址和网络配置。此检查仅验证基本连通性，不能替代分布式推理测试。"
